			"notes": "Paste an image link, or drop a picture file onto the block, and get vanilla map art you can craft and place like any other map.\n\n- Paste an image URL, or drag a local image file onto the block's screen\n- Build 1x1 up to 3x3 grids (up to 9 maps) for larger murals\n- Toggle dithering on or off before creating\n- Finished maps are locked, so walking around with one never overwrites it back into real terrain\n- The block takes empty maps from the top or sides and lets a hopper pull finished maps from below\n\nNeoForge 1.21.1 and 26.2. Install on both the client and the server. No other mods required."
